\section{Application Decision Guide}

\begin{bgdecision}[title={Match the question to the derivative tool}]
\begin{center}
\begin{tabularx}{\textwidth}{@{}p{.31\textwidth}X@{}}
\toprule
Question type&Primary tools\\\midrule
position, velocity, acceleration&first and second time derivatives; sign charts\\
small-change estimate&tangent-line linearization or differentials\\
measurement uncertainty&absolute and relative differentials\\
changing geometric quantities&related-rates equation differentiated in time\\
absolute extrema on a closed interval&endpoints plus interior critical numbers\\
local maxima or minima&first-derivative sign change or second-derivative test\\
increasing/decreasing behavior&sign of \(f'\)\\
concavity and inflection&sign of \(f''\) plus actual sign change\\
complete curve sketch&domain, limits, intercepts, \(f'\), and \(f''\)\\
